 combining sequence: café (decomposed)  
 and café (precomposed). A cluster      
 wider than a terminal cell: 𗀀ᩗ (a     
 Tangut base plus a spacing Tai Tham    
 mark: one grapheme, three columns) and 
 a zero-width space: a​b.                
                                        
