 ◈ Every diagram family through the     
   document path                        
 ────────────────────────────────────── 
                                        
 Each family is deliberately small:     
 these goldens exist to prove a diagram 
 survives margins, block spacing and a  
 40-column budget, and a diff nobody    
 can read would be rubber-stamped       
 rather than reviewed.                  
                                        
